footer='<footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-inner"><div><b>Utah Seasonal Guide</b><br>Fall & winter 2026–27 · Updated October 6, 2026</div><div><a href="/about/">About & accessibility</a><br><a href="/image-credits/">Image credits</a></div><div><a href="/submit/">Suggest an event or correction</a><br><a href="/?saved=1">Your saved events</a></div></div></footer>'
